---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="页面不存在" description="这个地址没有内容。">
  <section class="lab-container flex min-h-[60vh] flex-col justify-center py-20">
    <p class="lab-eyebrow mb-5">404</p>
    <h1 class="lab-display max-w-2xl">这一页，不动了。</h1>
    <p class="lab-lead mt-5 max-w-xl">地址可能是打错了，也可能是内容还没写。回到首页重新找。</p>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="mt-8 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border px-4 py-2 text-sm text-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted"
    >
      回首页 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</Base>
